          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful, thanks! I do eat out a lot, especially at my favorite local pizzeria. Any ways to eat out healthier, still enjoying pizza and all?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To eat healthier while enjoying pizza at your favorite pizzeria, consider these tips: \n\n1. **Choose Thin Crust**: Opt for a thin crust instead of deep pan to reduce calories and carbs.\n\n2. **Load Up on Veggies**: Select pizzas topped with plenty of vegetables like bell peppers, spinach, and mushrooms to increase fiber and nutrients.\n\n3. **Limit Cheese**: Ask for less cheese than usual or choose a pizza with a lighter cheese option to cut down on fat and calories.\n\n4. **Pair with a Salad**: Start your meal with a side salad to help fill you up with fiber, which can reduce the amount of pizza you eat.\n\n5. **Avoid High-Fat Toppings**: Skip high-fat toppings like pepperoni and sausage, and opt for lean proteins like grilled chicken.\n\n6. **Portion Control**: Consider sharing a pizza or choosing a smaller size to help manage portion sizes.\n\n7. **Stay Hydrated**: Drink water instead of sugary drinks to keep your calorie intake in check.\n\nBy making these adjustments, you can still enjoy your pizza while making healthier choices!",
