          "text": "Certain spices can help boost metabolism and support your weight loss goals. Ginger is a great option as it not only aids digestion but also increases metabolism and helps regulate blood sugar levels. Turmeric, another powerful spice, is known for its anti-inflammatory properties and may indirectly support weight loss by reducing inflammation in the body. Cayenne pepper, with its capsaicin content, can raise your body temperature and speed up metabolic processes, helping to burn calories even at rest.\n\nIncorporating these spices into your meals can be simple. For example, you can add ginger to smoothies or teas, turmeric to soups or rice dishes, and cayenne pepper to stir-fries or marinades. These small additions can complement your efforts to increase protein intake and adopt a healthier lifestyle. Let me know if you\u2019d like more ideas on how to use these spices in your cooking!",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0018-29-02371:0": 20.567699432373047,
            "clueweb22-en0038-94-09166:15": 20.258800506591797,
            "clueweb22-en0038-26-13938:11": 20.138700485229492
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "I want to increase my protein intake.",
            "I have gained weight recently because I stopped exercising for the last 6 months.",
            "I want to change my lifestyle."
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "judgment": {
      "rater-confidence": "High confidence",
      "subtopic-justification": "Response gives explanation of spices and how they impact metabolism. ",
      "relevance-and-usefulness": "Fully Meets",
