          "user_rubrik": "What are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Spices like cayenne pepper, ginger, turmeric, and cinnamon are known to support metabolism. Cayenne pepper contains capsaicin, which can increase calorie burning and fat oxidation. Ginger may enhance digestion and improve fat metabolism. Turmeric, while not directly boosting metabolism, can reduce inflammation, which supports overall metabolic health. Cinnamon helps regulate blood sugar levels, which can indirectly aid in maintaining a healthy metabolism. Incorporating these spices into your meals can be a flavorful way to support your lifestyle changes.",
