          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I want tips on how to get started with a healthier and more active lifestyle. Any basics I should know?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to get started to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To begin a healthier and more active lifestyle, start with short, regular exercise sessions\u2014such as 30 minutes of moderate-intensity cardio three times a week\u2014and slowly increase to five times a week as you build your fitness base [clueweb22-en0016-47-18469:8]. Choose activities you enjoy, like walking, cycling, or swimming, and consider joining group activities or classes for motivation [clueweb22-en0008-37-01091:6]. Nutrition is equally important: eat clean, avoid junk food and soda, and aim for several smaller meals throughout the day with a focus on protein and whole foods [clueweb22-en0000-52-13364:12]. Also, prioritize good sleep, manage stress, and allow for 1\u20132 rest days per week to prevent burnout [clueweb22-en0033-23-15567:2]. Mixing up your activities helps prevent boredom and overtraining. Would you like specific beginner workout routines or meal ideas?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0000-52-13364:12": 0.01639344262295082,
