          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For a simple, high-protein mango recipe, make Mango Chicken: sear chicken breast with bell peppers, then add fresh mango and a sweet-savory sauce\u2014serve over rice or quinoa for a balanced meal. This dish is quick to prepare and offers about 18.7g of protein per serving [clueweb22-en0002-68-12566:0][clueweb22-en0043-05-12137:7]. For a vegetarian option, try a Kale Pomegranate Salad: massage kale, toss with pomegranate arils, pear slices, walnuts, and goat cheese, and dress with a homemade pomegranate vinaigrette. Add chickpeas or white beans for extra protein [clueweb22-en0040-35-18309:16]. Both options are easy to prep after work and incorporate your favorite fruits. Are you interested in more vegetarian or vegan high-protein recipes?",
