      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I want to start living healthier and be more active. Any tips on where to begin?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to get started to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To begin living healthier, focus on simple habits like swapping processed foods for whole foods, preparing healthy snacks in advance, and making changes slowly to avoid feeling overwhelmed [clueweb22-en0001-07-05882]. For increasing activity, try integrating movement into your daily life\u2014such as taking the stairs, walking during breaks, or doing short home workouts that don't require special equipment [clueweb22-en0017-15-13697][clueweb22-en0026-18-03737]. As a software engineer with a sedentary job, it's especially helpful to set achievable goals and create a routine that fits your schedule and environment. Remember, consistency is key, and even small steps can lead to significant improvements over time. Are you interested in beginner-friendly home workout routines?",
          "citations": {
