      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Portable snacks would be great, but I'm also curious how to support better psychological health. Any practical steps?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a have better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Practical steps for better psychological health include practicing mindfulness meditation, which reduces stress, boosts mood, and improves concentration and creativity [clueweb22-en0000-53-03924]. Make time for activities you genuinely enjoy\u2014such as reading, listening to music, or trying a new hobby\u2014to prevent burnout and maintain balance. Adjusting your mindset by accepting stress, focusing on progress rather than perfection, and using positive affirmations can also help you cope more effectively [clueweb22-en0000-53-03924]. For busy professionals, being mindful of early signs of stress (like fatigue, brain fog, or lack of motivation) and taking breaks to calm your mind are important for both mental well-being and work performance [clueweb22-en0035-17-15264]. If you find persistent distress or anxiety, consider reaching out for professional psychological support, which can offer tailored strategies and therapy [clueweb22-en0013-21-13010]. Would you like specific mindfulness or meditation app recommendations?",
          "citations": {
