      {
        "turn": 9,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "A sample meal plan would be nice, but I also want to know what spices can boost metabolism.",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Several spices have been shown to support metabolism and may aid in weight loss. Cayenne pepper and other hot spices containing capsaicin (like jalape\u00f1os and habaneros) can increase metabolism by up to 25% and may also help reduce appetite and inflammation [clueweb22-en0019-94-16099]. Cinnamon, when consumed at about half a teaspoon daily, can improve blood sugar control and glucose metabolism, which supports weight management [clueweb22-en0026-84-09555]. Turmeric is known for its anti-inflammatory properties and can help reduce bloating and support metabolic health. Other pungent spices such as black pepper, mustard seeds, powdered onion, and ginger also help keep metabolic rates high [clueweb22-en0044-91-12074]. These spices are easy to add to meals or snacks, making them a practical way to support your weight loss and health goals. Are there any spices you want to avoid due to allergies or taste preferences?",
