          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To stay active while working from home, consider using active seating options like a cycle desk bike or fitness chair, which allow you to move while working at your desk [clueweb22-en0017-86-06959]. Incorporate simple desk exercises\u2014such as stretches, chair squats, or calf raises\u2014that require no equipment and can be done in a few minutes [clueweb22-en0011-85-13550]. Schedule short, regular breaks for quick workouts or walks, and try virtual fitness or yoga classes to add variety and structure to your routine [clueweb22-en0013-79-15579]. Creating a daily routine that includes these activities can help you maintain energy, improve focus, and support your overall health [clueweb22-en0036-98-06941]. Would you like a sample desk exercise routine?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0013-79-15579:3": 0.03896441380495243,
            "clueweb22-en0036-98-06941:2": 0.03545492270982467,
