      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Actually, I\u2019d like to hear more about psychological health too. What are some practical steps to have better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a have better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To improve your psychological health, prioritize getting close to 8 hours of sleep each night, as rest is essential for productivity and emotional well-being. Take time to appreciate small aspects of your day, such as a walk during breaks or enjoying nature, which can boost contentment. Incorporate stress-relief tools like a stress ball, and practice self-care regularly. Additionally, seek out actionable resources\u2014such as articles, podcasts, or online courses\u2014that offer practical tips for overcoming mental health challenges, improving communication, and supporting yourself and others. Building these habits into your daily routine, especially when working from home, can help you maintain a positive mindset and overall well-being [clueweb22-en0028-71-08545][clueweb22-en0012-61-02328][clueweb22-en0021-19-18665][clueweb22-en0021-57-05572]. Would you like specific mindfulness or stress-reduction exercises?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0028-71-08545:0": 0.023025530899546648,
            "clueweb22-en0012-61-02328:0": 0.022727272727272728,
            "clueweb22-en0021-19-18665:0": 0.022444170126809562,
