          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Foods that support both gut and mental health include fiber-rich fruits and vegetables, lean proteins, healthy fats like omega-3s, and fermented foods. Snack ideas: Greek yogurt with fruit, mixed nuts, or a smoothie with leafy greens and seeds. Would you like specific high-protein snack recipes?",
