      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "High-protein snack recipes would be great! Also, any suggestions for easy meals when eating out? I eat out pretty often.",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Great high-protein snack options include Greek yogurt with your favorite fruits (like mango or pomegranate), almond coconut protein bars with hemp seeds, and crispy salmon sticks, all of which are easy to prepare and portable [clueweb22-en0020-46-11667]. For meals out, choose dishes featuring lean meats (chicken, turkey, steak), beans, tofu, or eggs, and opt for salads or grain bowls with added protein. At restaurants like Panera, you can find balanced high-protein meals by selecting salads with chicken or eggs, grain bowls, or sandwiches with lean meats, and you can control extras like dressings or cheese by asking for them on the side [clueweb22-en0016-38-11777]. These strategies help you meet your protein goals whether you're at home or dining out. Are you interested in vegetarian or vegan high-protein meal options?",
          "citations": {
