      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Vegetarian options would be nice! Also, is eating dinner late at night a problem for health or weight loss?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For high-protein vegetarian snacks, try Greek yogurt with your favorite fruits (like mango or pomegranate), protein granola, or a hummus wrap with whole grain tortilla and fresh veggies [clueweb22-en0033-71-10651][clueweb22-en0007-42-18874]. Other options include double chocolate protein avocado brownies, protein-packed brown rice pudding, and nut-based snacks. For easy vegetarian meals when eating out, look for salads or grain bowls with beans, tofu, or eggs, and sandwiches or wraps with hummus or cheese [clueweb22-en0014-20-07042]. Regarding late-night dinners, research suggests that eating late can make weight loss harder and may negatively affect metabolic health by decreasing energy expenditure and glucose tolerance, potentially increasing the risk of weight gain and metabolic issues [clueweb22-en0013-15-12738]. Are you interested in meal prep tips for busy days?",
          "citations": {
