          "text": "To simplify meal prep, cook large batches of vegetarian proteins (like beans, lentils, or tofu) and pair them with pre-chopped veggies and whole grains for quick, balanced meals. Prepare snacks such as Greek yogurt with fruit, hummus wraps, or nut-based protein bars in advance. For boosting metabolism, incorporate spices like cayenne pepper (which contains capsaicin and can increase calorie burn and reduce appetite), cinnamon (which helps regulate blood sugar and improve glucose metabolism), turmeric (with anti-inflammatory properties), and ginger (which can enhance metabolic rate) into your dishes. These spices not only add flavor but also provide metabolic and health benefits, making them excellent additions to your daily meals and snacks [clueweb22-en0026-84-09555][clueweb22-en0019-94-16099][clueweb22-en0032-68-08051][clueweb22-en0044-91-12074]. Would you like specific vegetarian meal prep recipes?",
          "citations": {
