          "text": "To maintain a higher-protein, healthier lifestyle while eating out frequently, focus on these strategies:\n\n**Smart Ordering for Protein & Balance**\n- Prioritize lean protein mains: grilled chicken, fish, eggs, tofu, beans, or lean beef (look for \u201cloin\u201d or \u201cround\u201d cuts) ([clueweb22-en0009-38-14365], [clueweb22-en0033-09-12443]).\n- Request proteins grilled, baked, or steamed\u2014avoid fried or breaded options.\n- Add extra protein: ask for double meat, extra eggs, or a side of beans/yogurt.\n\n**Healthy Sides & Customization**\n- Swap fries or chips for vegetables, salads, or whole grains.\n- Ask for dressings and sauces on the side to control added fats and sugars.\n\n**Portion & Mindful Eating**\n- Watch portion sizes\u2014consider sharing or boxing half your meal.\n- Eat slowly and check in with your hunger cues.\n\n**Beverage Choices**\n- Choose water or unsweetened drinks over sodas or alcohol.\n\n**Consistency",
