          "text": "To stay motivated as you shift to a higher-protein, more active lifestyle after a period of inactivity, focus on these proven strategies:\n\n**1. Clarify Your \u201cWhy\u201d**\n- Identify personal reasons for change\u2014health, energy, confidence\u2014not just appearance. Remind yourself regularly (journaling, sticky notes) ([clueweb22-en0006-73-06795], [clueweb22-en0017-18-03917]).\n\n**2. Set Achievable, Short-Term Goals**\n- Break your journey into small, realistic steps (e.g., \u201cAdd protein to breakfast daily,\u201d \u201cWalk 10 minutes after lunch\u201d) to build momentum and confidence ([clueweb22-en0017-18-03917], [clueweb22-en0025-53-00700]).\n\n**3. Track Progress and Celebrate Wins**\n- Monitor weight, activity, or protein intake weekly. Celebrate non-scale victories (energy, mood, consistency) ([clueweb22-en0025-53-00700]).\n\n**4. Build Accountability and Support**",
