          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I want to get started with a healthier and more active lifestyle. Where should I start?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to get started to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "To stick to your new lifestyle, it's essential to set realistic goals and make a plan that you can maintain in the long term. Start by making small, achievable changes and",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0012-97-08225:10": 6.177731513977051,
