        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 9,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks for the variety! Changing subject a bit\u2014what are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Certain spices can help boost your metabolism. For example, cayenne pepper can increase metabolism and reduce appetite. Cinnamon can lower blood sugar and aid in the burning of fat cells. Turmeric has anti-inflammatory properties and can help reduce puffiness and bloating. Ginger can also help activate proteins that regulate calorie burning. Additionally, black pepper can help prevent the formation of new fat cells. These spices can be incorporated into your daily meals to help support your weight loss goals. You can add them to your food, drinks, or use them as supplements to get the benefits.   Please let me know if I can assist you further.",
