          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks! I actually always eat dinner pretty late because of my work schedule. Any suggestions for healthy late-night meals or snacks?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "Eating a late dinner can be challenging, but there are healthy options you can consider. For a late-night meal, try to opt for something light and balanced, such as a small portion of lean protein, vegetables, and whole grains. Some examples include a small serving of grilled chicken or fish with roasted vegetables, or a bowl of oatmeal with fruit and nuts. If you need a snack, choose something nutritious like non-fat milk, whole fruits, or a handful of nuts. Avoid heavy, greasy, or high-calorie foods that can disrupt your sleep and hinder your weight loss efforts. Also, be mindful of your portion sizes to maintain a healthy balance.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0037-72-06502:0": 6.148016929626465,
            "clueweb22-en0014-51-02287:14": 5.987761497497559,
