      {
        "turn": 8,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s great advice. I love fruits, especially kiwi, watermelon, and lately fresh mangoes. Are there specific fruits that are particularly good for weight loss?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "Kiwi, watermelon, and mangoes are all great choices for weight loss. Kiwi is high in fiber and low in calories, making it a great snack for weight loss. Watermelon is also low in calories and high in water content, which can help with hydration and weight loss. Mangoes are rich in vitamins and minerals, and they're also relatively low in calories. Other fruits that are good for weight loss include berries, such as blueberries and strawberries, which are high in antioxidants and fiber. Figs are also a good option, as they're low in calories and high in fiber, which can help with digestion and weight loss. Overall, incorporating a variety of fruits into your diet can help support your weight loss goals.",
          "citations": {
