            "clueweb22-en0017-18-03917:14": 2.829967975616455
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s a bit general. Can you give me some specific tips to actually get going, especially for someone who\u2019s gained weight after not exercising for half a year?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to get started to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To get started, try scheduling active time with friends or family, like going for a walk or hike. You can also begin with small, achievable goals, such as taking a short walk during your lunch break or following a simple exercise routine at home. Additionally, consider working with a trainer or health coach to help you create a personalized plan. Remember to stay hydrated and set realistic goals for yourself, especially since you're just starting out after a six-month break from exercise. Start with short, manageable sessions and gradually increase the duration and intensity as you become more comfortable.",
          "citations": {
