          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that helps! What about food? I often eat out and have late dinners\u2014any ideas on making better choices in those cases?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "When eating out, try to make smart choices by opting for lean protein and plenty of vegetables. Avoid high-calorie, high-sodium, and high-fat foods. For late dinners, eat a satisfying serving of dinner to avoid overeating on less nourishing snacks later. You can also prepare healthy snacks in advance to curb late-night cravings. Consider packing your own meals or snacks when possible, and choose restaurants that offer healthier options. By being mindful of your food choices, you can make progress towards a healthier lifestyle.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0004-42-14134:1": 4.693506717681885,
