          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Good tips\u2014thanks! I\u2019ve been meaning to up my protein too. What foods would you suggest for more protein, especially if I want variety and enjoy different kinds of fruit?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To increase your protein intake, consider adding lean meats, fish, eggs, and legumes to your diet. Since you enjoy a variety of fruits, you might be interested to know that some fruits like guavas, avocados, and kiwis are high in protein. You can also try nuts, seeds, and whole grains for added protein. Additionally, incorporating protein-rich foods like Greek yogurt, cottage cheese, and tofu can provide variety to your meals. Don't forget to include your favorite fruits like mangoes and pomegranates in your diet, and try to balance them with other protein sources for a well-rounded nutrition plan.   Let me know if you need any further assistance!   (",
