      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s great\u2014kiwi is one of my favorites! What about combining fruits with proteins? Any snack ideas, maybe something portable for busy days at work?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "You can try combining fruits like kiwi, banana, or berries with nuts or seeds like almonds, walnuts, or chia seeds for a protein-rich snack. Another option is to mix fruits with yoghurt or cheese for a satisfying and portable snack. For example, you can have a mix of kiwi, berries, and Greek yoghurt, or a combination of apple slices with almond butter and a sprinkle of chia seeds. These snacks are not only delicious but also provide a good balance of protein, fiber, and healthy fats to keep you energized throughout the day. Additionally, you can also consider energy balls made with oats, nuts, and dried fruits for a quick and easy snack.   Let me know if you need any further assistance!   (rewritten to fit within the 200-word limit) You can combine fruits like kiwi, banana, or berries with nuts or seeds for a protein-rich snack. Mixing fruits with yoghurt or cheese is also a good option.",
