        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Perfect, I love those ideas. On another note, what are some practical steps I can take for better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a have better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To improve your psychological health, consider setting realistic goals and taking small, achievable steps towards them. This can help you feel a sense of accomplishment and boost your confidence. Additionally, practicing self-care, such as getting enough sleep, exercising regularly, and engaging in activities that bring you joy, can also have a positive impact on your mental well-being. You can also try to manage stress by taking short breaks throughout the day, meditating, or practicing deep breathing exercises. Furthermore, seeking support from friends, family, or a mental health professional can provide you with a safe space to discuss your feelings and work through challenges. By taking these small steps, you can work towards creating a healthier and more balanced lifestyle.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0038-27-17437:3": 5.149346351623535,
            "clueweb22-en0018-48-10602:7": 3.140779972076416,
            "clueweb22-en0039-13-11829:9": 2.6439507007598877,
