        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thank you! Switching topic a bit\u2014is there any link between stomach acid reflux and psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik": "Is stomach acid reflux related to psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Yes, there is a connection between stomach acid reflux and psychological health. Stress and anxiety can exacerbate acid reflux symptoms, and frequent acid reflux can also trigger anxiety or anxious feelings. This can create a continuous circle where anxiety affects acid reflux and vice versa. Managing stress through activities like meditation and exercise may help relieve heartburn symptoms. If you're experiencing symptoms of acid reflux or anxiety, it's essential to talk to your doctor to find ways to manage them.",
