      {
        "turn": 10,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks! I\u2019m social and like to hang out\u2014any healthy activity ideas to do with friends instead of just eating out?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "You can try organizing activities like going for a walk, hike, or bike ride with your friends. Playing video games or board games together can also be a fun way to socialize while staying indoors. Additionally, you can consider hosting a potluck where everyone brings a healthy dish to share, or trying out a new recipe together. This way, you can still enjoy each other's company while promoting healthy habits. You can also try going to a local park or playing a sport together, like soccer or basketball, to get some exercise and have fun at the same time.",
