          "text": "To get started with a healthier and more active lifestyle, I would recommend setting specific and achievable goals for yourself. Since you've gained weight recently, let's focus on increasing your physical activity. Start by scheduling a 30-minute walk or jog into your daily routine, ideally during the morning or early evening. This will help you establish a consistent habit. Additionally, consider meal prepping or planning your meals in advance to ensure you're consuming a balanced diet rich in fruits, vegetables, and whole grains. You can also try incorporating some light exercises, such as yoga or bodyweight exercises, into your daily routine. Lastly, try to limit your screen time, especially before bed, and aim for 7-8 hours of sleep each night. Remember, small steps lead to significant changes over time. How do these suggestions sound?  |  Answer:  To get started with a healthier and more active lifestyle, I would recommend setting specific and achievable goals for yourself. Since you've gained weight recently,",
          "citations": {},
