          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful\u2014a standing desk or under-desk elliptical sounds interesting! What about practical things to support better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a have better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To support better psychological health, prioritize good sleep and foster strong social connections with friends and family. Incorporate relaxation techniques like meditation or yoga, and consider journaling to process your thoughts. Engaging in activities you enjoy, learning new skills, and maintaining a balanced diet are also beneficial. Remember to limit harmful substances like alcohol and drugs.",
