        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That makes sense. Maybe I should also try some breathing or mindfulness techniques. Any advice on breaking habits like late-night doom scrolling?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "To break the habit of late-night doom scrolling, try these practical tips:\nSet boundaries by using app-blocking apps, setting screen time limits, or putting your phone out of reach/out of your bedroom at night. Use a bedtime alarm as a reminder to stop. You can also dim your screen or use a red filter. Replace scrolling with positive activities like reading a book, listening to a podcast, or engaging in a hobby. Consider changing your screen to grayscale to reduce its visual appeal.",
