          "user_utterance": "I want to get started on a healthier and more active lifestyle. Any tips on where to begin?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to get started to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To start your healthier lifestyle, begin with regular exercise, like a 30-minute walk daily, which also aids weight management and acid reflux. Increase your intake of lean proteins such as fish, eggs, and legumes, consuming them with each meal for satiety. For acid reflux, ensure your last meal is at least 3 hours before bedtime, and avoid lying down immediately after eating. If you need a late-night snack, consider low-fat dairy or casein protein powder to minimize reflux.",
