      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That's really motivating. I actually want to increase my protein intake. Any advice for easy high-protein meals if I eat out a lot?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "When eating out, focus on meals centered around lean protein like chicken, fish, lean beef, or plant-based options such as tofu, paneer, or beans. Opt for salads, stir-fries, or wraps. To increase protein, add cheese, nuts, or seeds to your dishes. For easy high-protein snacks, choose options like hard-boiled eggs, Greek yogurt, or a handful of nuts.",
