        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, I love adding beans or chicken to salads. Are there certain spices that can help boost metabolism too?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Several spices can help boost your metabolism. These include **ginger**, which can activate calorie burning, and **turmeric**, which may modulate fat tissue development. **Black pepper** contains piperine, which can inhibit new fat cell formation and boost fat metabolism. **Cinnamon** aids in burning fat cells through thermogenesis. **Cayenne** and other hot peppers (like chili, habanero) contain capsaicin, known to increase metabolic rate and fat burning. Other beneficial spices are **cardamom**, **cloves**, **mustard**, and **cumin**, which also contribute to increased calorie burning and improved metabolism.",
