        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Tracking habits sounds doable. Can you suggest easy ways to track things like food and exercise?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For easy tracking of food and exercise, you can use smartphone apps like MyFitnessPal, Lose It, or FatSecret. These apps often have large food databases and allow you to quickly log meals and workouts. Many also sync with fitness trackers for effortless exercise logging. Alternatively, a simple food journal or diary, either paper or digital, is a great way to monitor your intake and activity.",
