        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting, I didn\u2019t realize that. What are some practical steps to have better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a have better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To improve your psychological health, several practical steps can be taken. Prioritize getting enough sleep and engage in regular physical activity. Building and maintaining strong social connections with family and friends is also crucial. Consider practicing stress management techniques like meditation or mindfulness. Journaling can help process thoughts and feelings, and adopting healthy daily habits, including a nutritious diet and engaging in enjoyable activities, further supports mental well-being.",
