        "turn": 10,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that\u2019s encouraging. Does late-night dinner affect weight loss efforts?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Yes, eating dinner late can affect weight loss efforts. Research suggests that calories consumed later at night are more likely to be stored as fat, rather than being used for energy. This is because your body's metabolism slows down in the evening, and fat burning can be impaired. Late-night eating can also lead to higher blood sugar levels and negatively impact your metabolic health, making weight management more challenging.",
