          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m curious about how to get started with a healthier and more active lifestyle. What\u2019s the best first step?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to get started to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The best first step to a healthier lifestyle is to start small and gradually incorporate changes. Begin by identifying less healthy habits and replacing them with positive ones, such as healthier eating and increasing your daily physical activity. Even small changes like taking the stairs or a short walk can make a significant difference. Consider tracking your current habits to see where you can improve, then make a plan and adjust as you go.",
