      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Those ideas are useful. I want to eat more protein. How can I do that easily, especially with late-night dinners?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For easy ways to increase your protein intake, especially with late-night dinners, focus on quick-prep, protein-rich options. Cottage cheese and Greek yogurt are excellent choices, offering slow-digesting protein that can aid muscle repair overnight. You can also make a smoothie with casein, whey, or plant-based protein powder. Other simple options include lean meats like turkey or chicken in a sandwich, hummus with veggies, or adding nuts, seeds, or nut butters to your meals.",
