          "user_utterance": "Makes sense. What lifestyle changes help with both reflux and mental health?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To improve both acid reflux and psychological health, adopt integrated lifestyle changes. Prioritize stress management with techniques like yoga, meditation, and deep breathing. Ensure regular physical activity and sufficient sleep. For diet, embrace a balanced approach with smaller, more frequent meals, and avoid common triggers like spicy, acidic, and fatty foods, as well as alcohol and caffeine. Additionally, seek out happiness and manage your schedule to reduce stress.",
