          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That makes sense. I\u2019m curious\u2014can certain spices boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Yes, several spices can help boost your metabolism and support weight loss efforts. Spices like ginger, cayenne pepper, and cinnamon are known for their thermogenic properties, meaning they can increase calorie burning and fat metabolism. Black pepper, turmeric, garlic, and cardamom also contribute by enhancing metabolic rate, suppressing appetite, or inhibiting fat cell formation. Incorporating these into your meals can be a flavorful way to support your weight loss goals.",
