      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting how connected our minds and bodies are. Do you have any advice for breaking out of unhealthy patterns, like doom scrolling or spending too much time on my phone?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To break unhealthy digital habits like doom scrolling, consider practical steps such as setting screen time limits using apps or your phone's built-in settings, and turning off unnecessary notifications. Create physical boundaries by keeping your phone out of your bedroom, especially at night, and establishing media-free times, like during meals. Replace scrolling with positive activities you enjoy, such as reading, exercising, or connecting with friends in person. You can also try a digital detox by scheduling specific times to completely unplug from your devices.",
