      {
        "turn": 9,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s smart! On another note, what are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Several spices can help boost your metabolism. These include hot spices like cayenne pepper, chili peppers, and hot sauce, which contain capsaicin and can increase calorie burning. Other beneficial spices are ginger, turmeric, black pepper, cinnamon, cardamom, cloves, mustard, garlic, and cumin. They work through various mechanisms like inducing thermogenesis, regulating fat tissue formation, or improving digestion.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0037-43-08411:14": 4.95851054516819,
