          "user_utterance": "That sounds doable! Any quick meal ideas to boost nutrition, especially with more protein? I eat out a lot, so easy options would be great.",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To boost your protein intake with quick and easy meals, consider options like sheet pan dishes (e.g., miso ginger tempeh, lemon rosemary chicken), stir-fries (chopped chili chicken, beef yakisoba), or make-ahead lunches such as Mediterranean pasta salad or high-protein soups. For quick grabs, hard-boiled eggs, Greek yogurt, cottage cheese toast, or a simple peanut butter sandwich are great. Meal prepping items like air fryer turkey burgers or black bean burgers can also save time during busy weeks.",
