          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Those tips sound good! I want to try internet detoxing soon. Could you suggest some offline activities to help me stick with it?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To help you stick to an internet detox, engage in activities that require your full attention and get you away from screens. Consider reading books, journaling, or pursuing creative hobbies like crafting, drawing, knitting, or gardening. Spend quality time with friends and family in person, go for walks, exercise, or explore new places. You can also focus on home-based tasks like cooking, cleaning, or meal prepping. Prioritize sufficient sleep and engage in activities that help you relax and unwind.",
