          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking for advice on getting started with a healthier and more active lifestyle. Any simple tips or steps?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to get started to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To begin your healthier lifestyle, start with simple steps. Since excess weight can contribute to acid reflux, focus on gradually increasing physical activity, like a 30-minute walk, and eating healthier. Aim for smaller, more frequent meals throughout the day instead of large ones, especially with your late dinner habit. Increase your protein intake with lean meats, fish, tofu, or beans, as this helps with satiety and weight management. Fill half your plate with non-starchy vegetables, a quarter with protein, and a quarter with fiber-rich starches. Enjoy a variety of fruits as healthy snacks or part of meals.",
