      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great advice! I like the idea of smaller, frequent meals and more protein. Sometimes I find walking a bit boring though\u2014any other fun ways to stay active for someone who sits a lot at work?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Since you find walking boring and sit a lot, consider more dynamic and engaging activities! Dancing is a great full-body workout and can be very fun. Table tennis is an excellent indoor option that keeps your mind and body sharp. Swimming is a fantastic low-impact exercise. For team play, consider basketball or soccer. You could also try cycling, or even exergames like Nintendo Wii to make activity fun at home. The key is to find activities you genuinely enjoy to make them sustainable.",
