        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Nice, I love the idea of exergames! I\u2019ve also been pretty stressed lately\u2014any practical steps for better psychological health while working on physical health?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a have better psychological health?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To boost your psychological health, especially with stress, integrate mindfulness practices like meditation, deep breathing, or yoga into your routine. Continue with regular physical activity, as exercise is great for both mind and body, reducing stress and improving mood. Prioritize adequate sleep and connect with friends and family for support. Engaging in hobbies you enjoy also helps manage stress and promotes well-being.",
