      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting! I didn\u2019t realize how connected they are. If I want to avoid late-night eating (which I tend to do), any tips for breaking that habit?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To break the habit of late-night eating, ensure you eat balanced, protein and fiber-rich meals throughout the day to prevent excessive hunger. Remove tempting junk foods from your home to eliminate easy access. Before eating late, pause and practice mindfulness: ask yourself if you're truly hungry or if it's due to boredom, stress, or tiredness. Establishing a \"no-eating-after-dinner\" rule can also be very effective.",
          "citations": {
