        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Those are helpful! I like the hobby idea. I\u2019ve been thinking about internet detoxing\u2014how should I approach that as a first-timer?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to lose weight?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "To approach an internet detox as a first-timer, start gradually. Begin with short \"no-tech\" breaks, like 15 minutes, and slowly increase the duration. You can also designate specific days to avoid certain platforms. Inform friends or family about your detox for accountability, and consider deleting apps or blocking websites to reduce temptation. Replace screen time with engaging hobbies or activities you enjoy, and set a \"digital bedtime\" for your devices at least an hour before sleep.",
