          "user_rubrik": "What are some spices that can help boost metabolism?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Spices like ginger, turmeric, black pepper, cinnamon, and cayenne pepper are known to help boost metabolism. Ginger and cayenne have thermogenic properties, increasing heat production and calorie burning. Black pepper's piperine can boost fat metabolism, while cinnamon aids in burning fat cells and improving sugar handling. Garlic, mustard, cloves, and cardamom also contribute to a higher metabolic rate.",
