          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s super helpful! I definitely eat dinner late and tend to eat out a lot\u2014sometimes at my local pizzeria. Any practical ideas for making eating out healthier, especially at places like pizza spots?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some practical steps to have a healthier and more active lifestyle?",
